	(text "- Lidar PWM is connected on TIMER 2 Ch2p\n- Lidar Serial is connected on USART2\n- Leds RGB are connected on TIMER 1 Ch2n\n- IMU_nINT is connected on EXTI0\n- IMU is on I2C2, SS_BUS is on I2C1\n- PB8 is unused because it is the BOOT0 pin\n- PG10 is unused because it is the RESET pin\n- VCP is connected on LPUART1"
